1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 16=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,680
Young Lady.

7
00:02:12,759 --> 00:02:13,799
I've finished applying it.

8
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,000
Come and sit down.

9
00:02:18,808 --> 00:02:20,350
- Young Lady...
- Sit right here.

10
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,720
Don't go anywhere

11
00:02:22,159 --> 00:02:23,359
until I come back.

12
00:02:23,879 --> 00:02:24,799
Young Lady.

13
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:39,759
I thought I'd keep trying,

14
00:03:40,024 --> 00:03:42,070
and once I'd earned merit
and been promoted,

15
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:46,239
I'd have the nerve
to come and ask for your hand.

16
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:50,239
But he's a marquis.

17
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,639
No matter how hard I try

18
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:55,280
for the rest of my life,
I can never measure up to him.

19
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,400
I...

20
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,959
I'm not worthy of you.

21
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,239
Zheng.

22
00:04:06,599 --> 00:04:08,479
Don't say that.

23
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:13,199
I don't care whether
we're well matched or not.

24
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,720
I only want to marry you.

25
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:22,759
Someday, when you see other young ladies

26
00:04:23,224 --> 00:04:25,432
become the wives
of high-ranking officials,

27
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:27,639
you'll regret it.

28
00:04:34,199 --> 00:04:35,560
Never.

29
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:39,599
I'm not like other young ladies.

30
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:42,480
I don't care
about family status or rank.

31
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,040
Zheng.

32
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:51,279
I...

33
00:04:51,519 --> 00:04:54,000
I only want to marry you.

34
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:43,159
We share in both honor and disgrace.

35
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,839
She's your second sister.

36
00:07:46,399 --> 00:07:47,838
If her reputation is ruined,

37
00:07:47,839 --> 00:07:49,279
yours will suffer, too.

38
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:04,759
Young...

39
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,320
Sit down.

40
00:08:13,759 --> 00:08:14,959
These clothes...

41
00:08:16,439 --> 00:08:18,159
I've never left.

42
00:08:18,399 --> 00:08:21,040
We've been playing in
the pavilion together the whole time.

43
00:08:30,199 --> 00:08:31,480
No cheating.

44
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:33,479
You lost, so you
have to bark like a dog.

45
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,320
Hurry.

46
00:08:35,519 --> 00:08:37,199
Hurry and bark.

47
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:41,199
Woof, woof.

48
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,800
Louder.

49
00:08:45,799 --> 00:08:46,999
Louder.

50
00:08:47,039 --> 00:08:49,280
Woof.

51
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:52,038
Keep barking as you go.

52
00:08:52,039 --> 00:08:53,560
You can't stop until I say so.

53
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:58,040
Woof.

54
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,160
Woof.

55
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:01,959
Woof.

56
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:05,040
Woof, woof.

57
00:09:08,639 --> 00:09:09,640
Woof.

58
00:09:14,799 --> 00:09:15,719
I'll go first.

59
00:09:17,759 --> 00:09:19,239
Once I've tricked them into leaving,

60
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,440
you can go.

61
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,440
Xiuwan.

62
00:09:37,279 --> 00:09:38,400
Woof, woof.

63
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,839
Woof.

64
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:42,920
Woof.

65
00:09:43,559 --> 00:09:44,359
Woof.

66
00:09:46,759 --> 00:09:47,879
Woof, woof.

67
00:09:59,519 --> 00:10:01,079
- Xiuwan.
- Second Young Lady.

68
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,950
You're a young lady
from a respectable family,

69
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,760
yet you're making
a maid bark like a dog.

70
00:10:07,559 --> 00:10:08,719
How improper.

71
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:14,999
Just look at yourself.

72
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,839
No one in this residence mistreats you.

73
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,120
Yet you're timid all day long,

74
00:10:18,130 --> 00:10:20,870
without any of the bearing of
a young lady from a respectable family.

75
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,560
Where were you just now?

76
00:10:27,919 --> 00:10:31,359
Why didn't I see you when I came over?

77
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:34,239
Tongcao and I were
in the pavilion on the hill,

78
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,560
playing cat's cradle.

79
00:10:35,799 --> 00:10:38,839
We agreed that whoever
lost would bark like a dog.

80
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,959
All right.

81
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,560
I'm tired from walking around, too.

82
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,839
Come back with me.

83
00:11:15,879 --> 00:11:17,239
What are you looking at?

84
00:11:19,879 --> 00:11:21,680
Cuique and Zheng

85
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:24,959
are probably going to pay
their respects to First Madam.

86
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:27,040
Should we stop them

87
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:29,479
and tell them Xiushu is ill,

88
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,400
so they don't disturb First Madam?

89
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:34,119
Zheng once saved Jinqi's life.

90
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:36,839
No matter how busy First Madam is,
she'll make time to see Zheng.

91
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:47,999
Go wait quietly outside Zhichun Hall.

92
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,079
As soon as Jinqi returns,

93
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,520
come find me at once.

94
00:11:50,559 --> 00:11:51,760
Keep it quiet.

95
00:12:00,759 --> 00:12:01,640
Hurry.

96
00:12:03,799 --> 00:12:04,558
First Madam.

97
00:12:04,559 --> 00:12:05,920
Physician Li is here.

98
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,959
First Madam Lin.

99
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:09,950
I'm sorry to trouble you

100
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,719
with two visits to Lin Residence

101
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,839
in a single day.

102
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:15,359
A physician's first concern
is his patients. It's only right.

103
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,798
Xiushu took the medicine you prescribed,

104
00:12:18,799 --> 00:12:20,319
but instead of fading,

105
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,959
the rash has gotten worse.

106
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:24,400
She also feels a little feverish to me.

107
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:33,158
It's erysipelas.

108
00:12:33,159 --> 00:12:34,400
Erysipelas?

109
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:36,990
According to Treatise on the Origins
and Symptoms of Diseases,

110
00:12:37,048 --> 00:12:39,270
"Dan" refers to the skin
suddenly turning bright red,

111
00:12:39,279 --> 00:12:40,839
as if painted with cinnabar,

112
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:42,199
hence the name "dan."

113
00:12:43,032 --> 00:12:45,240
When I saw her this morning,
it had just begun

114
00:12:45,288 --> 00:12:46,920
and looked very much like a pollen rash.

115
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:49,760
Now that she has a headache and fever,

116
00:12:49,879 --> 00:12:51,280
it's clearly erysipelas.

117
00:12:51,799 --> 00:12:53,079
Is it serious?

118
00:12:53,279 --> 00:12:54,439
Don't worry, First Madam.

119
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:57,079
As long as it's treated promptly,
she'll make a full recovery.

120
00:12:58,480 --> 00:12:59,959
I'll write a prescription first.

121
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:01,079
Good, good, good.

122
00:13:10,340 --> 00:13:13,820
(Astragalus, Coptis,
Phellodendron, Licorice, Forsythia)

123
00:13:15,159 --> 00:13:16,400
Go get the medicine.

124
00:13:18,879 --> 00:13:20,439
Thank you, Physician Li.

125
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:22,280
I'll take my leave.

126
00:13:22,679 --> 00:13:23,558
Madam Wu.

127
00:13:23,559 --> 00:13:25,119
See Physician Li out.

128
00:13:25,159 --> 00:13:25,920
Yes.

129
00:13:42,759 --> 00:13:43,558
Physician Li.

130
00:13:43,559 --> 00:13:44,719
I'll see you out.

131
00:13:45,759 --> 00:13:46,879
All right.

132
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:08,199
Physician Li.

133
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:11,479
I've been going in and out all day

134
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,678
and exposed to the wind.

135
00:14:12,679 --> 00:14:15,040
Now I've developed
a slight red rash, too.

136
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:17,599
Could I trouble you to take a look

137
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:20,320
and see whether
it's a pollen rash or erysipelas?

138
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:21,959
Let me see.

139
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,079
Let me see.

140
00:14:25,279 --> 00:14:26,440
Take a look.

141
00:14:28,919 --> 00:14:30,079
Physician Li.

142
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,320
Is this...

143
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,959
Yes. It's erysipelas.

144
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,160
It's erysipelas.

145
00:14:35,170 --> 00:14:37,918
Then I can use Fourth Young Lady's
prescription for my medicine, right?

146
00:14:37,919 --> 00:14:38,599
Yes.

147
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:40,158
Yes, you can.

148
00:14:40,159 --> 00:14:42,040
Thank you, Physician Li.

149
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:43,479
I just thought

150
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:45,839
the sooner I take the medicine
and get it under control,

151
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:48,040
the less likely it is
to interfere with my duties.

152
00:14:48,504 --> 00:14:50,790
I just remembered
I have something urgent to attend to.

153
00:14:50,799 --> 00:14:52,278
No need to see me out, Madam.

154
00:14:52,279 --> 00:14:54,719
- It's fine, Physician Li.
- No need. Really.

155
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:55,479
Take care.

156
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:56,350
No need to see me out.

157
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:58,239
Physician Li. Watch your step.

158
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:02,839
- Watch your step.
- Physician Li!

159
00:15:04,519 --> 00:15:05,640
Physician Li!

160
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:07,918
Madam Wu.

161
00:15:07,919 --> 00:15:09,918
Young Master
has a few questions for Physician Li.

162
00:15:09,919 --> 00:15:11,719
I can see him out instead.

163
00:15:18,759 --> 00:15:19,999
Physician Li!

164
00:15:23,279 --> 00:15:24,400
Physician Li!

165
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,160
Physician Li!

166
00:15:30,519 --> 00:15:31,720
After Yuchan took the medicine,

167
00:15:31,730 --> 00:15:32,952
she's been sleeping ever since.

168
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:35,038
From what I can tell,
her fever hasn't gotten worse,

169
00:15:35,039 --> 00:15:36,239
but it hasn't gone down either.

170
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,319
The rash on her body

171
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:38,999
looks even more red and swollen.

172
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:41,470
I really have
something urgent to attend to.

173
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,680
Something urgent.

174
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,359
Physician Li.

175
00:15:45,159 --> 00:15:46,280
Young Lady,

176
00:15:46,344 --> 00:15:48,344
illness comes swiftly,
but recovery takes time.

177
00:15:48,392 --> 00:15:50,070
What I prescribed
isn't some miracle cure.

178
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:53,678
How could she recover
the moment she takes it? It takes time.

179
00:15:53,679 --> 00:15:54,839
But the swelling

180
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:56,079
looks like it's about to burst.

181
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:57,400
That's normal. It's normal.

182
00:15:57,416 --> 00:15:59,160
Once the heat is released,
she'll be fine.

183
00:15:59,208 --> 00:16:00,790
I have something urgent to attend to.

184
00:16:00,799 --> 00:16:02,558
Tomorrow. I'll definitely come tomorrow.

185
00:16:02,559 --> 00:16:03,599
I'll definitely come.

186
00:16:09,559 --> 00:16:11,680
We're hardly monsters.

187
00:16:11,919 --> 00:16:13,560
Why is he in such a panic?

188
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,280
Madam Wu.

189
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,160
Madam Wu.

190
00:16:34,279 --> 00:16:36,879
Why was Physician Li
called here twice today?

191
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:39,079
Did Fourth Young Lady's
pollen rash get worse?

192
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:44,158
You're a maid at Zhichun Hall.

193
00:16:44,159 --> 00:16:46,640
Your duty is to serve Young Master well.

194
00:16:47,159 --> 00:16:48,278
Look.

195
00:16:48,279 --> 00:16:50,079
The night curfew is about to begin.

196
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,918
Young Master should be back by now,

197
00:16:51,919 --> 00:16:54,479
yet you're here asking
questions about everything.

198
00:16:54,679 --> 00:16:56,239
You have no sense of propriety.

199
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:58,719
Thank you for the reminder, Madam.

200
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:00,239
I'll remember.

201
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:26,000
How did it go?

202
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,720
Did you see Physician Li?

203
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:31,959
I did, but he was in a hurry to leave.

204
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:33,399
He hurriedly said

205
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:35,199
it's normal even if the swelling bursts.

206
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:37,760
The pathogenic heat
in the body has to come out.

207
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:39,639
He'll come back tomorrow
to check on her.

208
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:48,518
Don't worry too much.
She's only had one dose of medicine.

209
00:17:48,519 --> 00:17:50,320
Maybe her fever
will be gone by tomorrow.

210
00:17:56,519 --> 00:17:58,038
Lanxiang.

211
00:17:58,039 --> 00:17:59,199
Young Master is back.

212
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:00,280
Hurry.

213
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:02,679
Go on.

214
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:04,439
I'll take good care of Yuchan.

215
00:18:37,319 --> 00:18:38,480
Just leave the water there.

216
00:18:38,599 --> 00:18:39,439
Yes.

217
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,999
This water was just boiled.

218
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:45,159
Be careful. It's hot.

219
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:03,719
Young Master.

220
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,439
Your bath is ready.

221
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:21,240
Young Lady Du is here.

222
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:28,240
I'm exhausted.

223
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:32,439
Hurry and send her away for me.

224
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:49,800
Young Lady Du.

225
00:19:50,119 --> 00:19:51,599
Is Jinqi here?

226
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:54,599
Young Master is taking a bath.

227
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:57,399
If it isn't urgent,

228
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:59,078
you can come inside and have some tea

229
00:19:59,079 --> 00:20:00,660
while you wait for him to finish bathing.

230
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:08,879
It's nothing urgent.

231
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,430
It's just that these past two days,

232
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:12,758
Jinqi has been on leave
from the Shence Garrison.

233
00:20:12,759 --> 00:20:14,479
My brother came to see me today

234
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:17,558
and brought some things for Jinqi.

235
00:20:17,559 --> 00:20:19,318
He said they were gifts from the men

236
00:20:19,319 --> 00:20:21,040
of the Shence Garrison for Jinqi,

237
00:20:21,079 --> 00:20:23,000
and asked me to pass them on to him.

238
00:20:23,359 --> 00:20:24,639
Thank you, Young Lady Du.

239
00:20:28,280 --> 00:20:29,630
I'll leave you to your work.

240
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:31,000
I'll be going.

241
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,320
Take care, Young Lady Du.

242
00:20:48,872 --> 00:20:50,470
Young Master wants to turn in early.

243
00:20:50,480 --> 00:20:51,919
Lock the courtyard gate.

244
00:20:52,279 --> 00:20:53,079
All right.

245
00:21:18,480 --> 00:21:19,720
Let's see what they sent.

246
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:33,119
Some local specialties.

247
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:36,479
There's wood ear,
dried daylily, and red dates.

248
00:21:36,480 --> 00:21:39,079
The Gastrodia looks like
the most valuable item.

249
00:21:42,759 --> 00:21:44,200
You can decide what to do with them.

250
00:21:44,599 --> 00:21:47,040
When you have time,
prepare some gifts in return.

251
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,800
Nothing expensive,

252
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:50,399
but make sure they're practical,

253
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:52,000
things they can use every day.

254
00:21:53,119 --> 00:21:53,879
Yes.

255
00:22:09,640 --> 00:22:11,280
Young Master, aren't you going to bathe?

256
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:18,838
I poured a whole bucket
of hot water in earlier

257
00:22:18,839 --> 00:22:20,960
to make some splashing sounds.

258
00:22:21,279 --> 00:22:22,079
It's a little hot.

259
00:22:25,319 --> 00:22:26,960
Then I'll get some cold water.

260
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:33,119
Third Young Lady.

261
00:22:38,799 --> 00:22:40,079
What are you doing here?

262
00:22:40,240 --> 00:22:41,879
Why don't you even have a maid with you?

263
00:22:44,720 --> 00:22:45,919
Jinqi.

264
00:22:46,960 --> 00:22:48,760
I have something to tell you.

265
00:22:53,559 --> 00:22:54,800
Lanxiang, stay.

266
00:22:57,640 --> 00:22:58,760
There's no need to avoid her.

267
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:00,599
She'll find out sooner or later anyway.

268
00:23:10,319 --> 00:23:11,480
Jinqi.

269
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:13,280
I...

270
00:23:15,319 --> 00:23:16,800
There's something...

271
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:19,480
I don't know how to say it.

272
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:20,999
Jinqi.

273
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,620
Please don't be angry
when you hear this.

274
00:23:22,632 --> 00:23:24,136
You have to believe me.

275
00:23:24,599 --> 00:23:26,879
I'm not jealous of Xiuwan.

276
00:23:26,880 --> 00:23:28,078
I'm not trying to frame her

277
00:23:28,079 --> 00:23:29,639
or deliberately speak ill of her.

278
00:23:29,640 --> 00:23:31,240
I... I...

279
00:23:32,559 --> 00:23:33,320
I...

280
00:23:36,680 --> 00:23:37,439
I...

281
00:23:40,559 --> 00:23:42,679
I...

282
00:23:43,599 --> 00:23:45,200
I...

283
00:23:48,119 --> 00:23:50,280
Of course I believe you.

284
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:51,879
Don't be afraid.

285
00:23:52,119 --> 00:23:53,280
And don't panic.

286
00:23:53,839 --> 00:23:55,480
Whatever happens,

287
00:23:55,640 --> 00:23:57,159
I'm here for you.

288
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:00,800
Jinqi.

289
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:04,639
Today, I accidentally saw something

290
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:06,159
I shouldn't have seen.

291
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:07,280
Young Master.

292
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:20,639
I have something
to take care of right now.

293
00:24:20,839 --> 00:24:22,359
I'll hear you out later.

294
00:24:23,319 --> 00:24:25,399
Have Madam Han
escort Third Young Lady back.

295
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:26,359
Yes.

296
00:24:36,480 --> 00:24:37,520
Young Master.

297
00:24:38,759 --> 00:24:39,919
Your wound...

298
00:24:41,519 --> 00:24:42,839
It's not my blood.

299
00:24:44,280 --> 00:24:46,550
Following the clues from the household
registers and travel permits,

300
00:24:46,568 --> 00:24:49,050
we traced them all the way
and confirmed it was the Dai family.

301
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:50,278
However,

302
00:24:50,279 --> 00:24:52,439
they've probably realized
we're investigating them.

303
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,359
I'm afraid

304
00:24:56,240 --> 00:24:57,639
they're about to make a move.

305
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:01,119
Marquis Yongchang is in danger.

306
00:25:09,839 --> 00:25:11,278
Are you going out, Young Master?

307
00:25:11,279 --> 00:25:12,720
The night curfew has already begun.

308
00:25:13,640 --> 00:25:14,839
Tonight,

309
00:25:15,079 --> 00:25:16,800
I never left Zhichun Hall.

310
00:25:21,279 --> 00:25:22,879
Young Master was tired,

311
00:25:22,880 --> 00:25:25,159
so I helped Young Master
take a hot bath.

312
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:25,959
After his bath,

313
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:28,919
Young Master fell asleep and
slept straight through until morning.

314
00:25:33,279 --> 00:25:35,000
You're too clever

315
00:25:36,799 --> 00:25:40,200
to be a maid.

316
00:26:12,279 --> 00:26:14,599
What are you staring at the wall for?

317
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:15,879
Where's Young Master?

318
00:26:17,039 --> 00:26:18,800
Young Master is still taking a bath.

319
00:26:18,920 --> 00:26:20,239
He said he was tired

320
00:26:20,240 --> 00:26:21,800
and wanted to soak a little longer.

321
00:26:22,119 --> 00:26:23,758
You've had a long day, too, Madam Han.

322
00:26:23,759 --> 00:26:25,470
Baogai has already
prepared some hot water

323
00:26:25,480 --> 00:26:28,000
and had a young maid
carry it to your room.

324
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:29,078
Don't worry, Madam.

325
00:26:29,079 --> 00:26:30,560
Baogai and I are here.

326
00:26:31,799 --> 00:26:32,879
All right.

327
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:34,320
Keep an eye on things.

328
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:35,919
I'll go get some rest then.

329
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:07,439
By order of the Defense Command,

330
00:28:07,759 --> 00:28:09,439
Duke Xiangguo has ordered

331
00:28:10,039 --> 00:28:11,560
Lin Residence sealed off.

332
00:28:11,640 --> 00:28:13,439
No one is allowed to enter or leave.

333
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:15,159
Anyone who disobeys

334
00:28:15,160 --> 00:28:16,639
will be killed on the spot.

335
00:28:16,759 --> 00:28:17,599
Seal it.

336
00:28:18,100 --> 00:28:19,700
(Jinling Defense Command)

337
00:28:24,119 --> 00:28:25,399
See what's going on.

338
00:28:29,160 --> 00:28:30,520
It won't open.

339
00:28:30,720 --> 00:28:31,798
- It won't open.
- Why won't the door open?

340
00:28:31,799 --> 00:28:33,518
Head Butler. Someone sealed the gate
from the outside.

341
00:28:33,519 --> 00:28:34,679
We can't open it.

342
00:28:34,680 --> 00:28:35,800
We can't get the gate open.

343
00:28:37,480 --> 00:28:38,879
Climb up and take a look.

344
00:28:50,039 --> 00:28:51,318
Help!

345
00:28:51,319 --> 00:28:52,480
Run!

346
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:55,399
Help!

347
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:56,279
Run!

348
00:28:56,280 --> 00:28:58,899
(Jinling Defense Command)

349
00:28:58,900 --> 00:29:01,979
(Glorify the Family Name)

350
00:29:01,980 --> 00:29:03,999
(Yuan Shaohui's Study)

351
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:06,599
I am Marquis Yongchang,
a title held in perpetuity.

352
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:08,798
How dare the Dai family

353
00:29:08,800 --> 00:29:09,976
try to assassinate me?

354
00:29:10,072 --> 00:29:11,710
Aren't they afraid of the death penalty?

355
00:29:11,720 --> 00:29:12,959
If we uncover

356
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:14,520
their collusion with Wo pirates,

357
00:29:14,550 --> 00:29:16,200
that would also be punishable by death.

358
00:29:17,039 --> 00:29:19,518
We still haven't obtained
any conclusive evidence,

359
00:29:19,519 --> 00:29:21,159
but as long as we keep pursuing them,

360
00:29:21,319 --> 00:29:23,079
they'll live in fear day and night.

361
00:29:23,119 --> 00:29:24,879
Only by getting rid of us

362
00:29:25,464 --> 00:29:27,350
can they end this threat
once and for all.

363
00:29:27,599 --> 00:29:30,919
Their actions are despicable,
and their intentions are deadly.

364
00:29:36,319 --> 00:29:38,879
If they would ambush and assassinate me,

365
00:29:41,160 --> 00:29:43,119
how do they plan to deal with you?

366
00:29:47,599 --> 00:29:48,199
Your Lordship.

367
00:29:48,200 --> 00:29:49,480
Jiugao requests an audience.

368
00:29:50,720 --> 00:29:51,679
Let him in.

369
00:29:54,759 --> 00:29:55,518
Your Lordship.

370
00:29:55,528 --> 00:29:56,184
Young Master.

371
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:59,030
The Imperial Medical Service
reported an epidemic in the residence.

372
00:29:59,030 --> 00:30:00,792
Several people have
already been infected.

373
00:30:00,824 --> 00:30:02,590
For the safety
of everyone else in the city,

374
00:30:02,680 --> 00:30:03,720
Duke Xiangguo ordered

375
00:30:03,730 --> 00:30:05,590
the Commander
of the Central City Patrol Office

376
00:30:05,599 --> 00:30:07,078
to surround Lin Residence with troops.

377
00:30:07,079 --> 00:30:08,479
No one is allowed to enter or leave.

378
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:12,280
They've... They've already
shot and killed a servant.

379
00:30:13,799 --> 00:30:16,639
For word of the epidemic
to reach Duke Xiangguo so quickly,

380
00:30:16,799 --> 00:30:18,679
Dai Rong must have had a hand in it.

381
00:30:19,799 --> 00:30:22,000
So this is the Dai family's move.

382
00:30:22,240 --> 00:30:25,079
Luckily, I slipped out
of the residence in secret beforehand.

383
00:30:25,480 --> 00:30:29,119
Otherwise,
I'd already be trapped inside.

384
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:30,720
Nanke.

385
00:30:31,519 --> 00:30:32,318
Young Master.

386
00:30:32,319 --> 00:30:33,439
You're the most skilled.

387
00:30:33,440 --> 00:30:35,608
Find a way to slip back
into the residence unnoticed

388
00:30:35,640 --> 00:30:37,350
and see what
the situation is like inside.

389
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:38,840
Also tell First Madam not to panic.

390
00:30:38,888 --> 00:30:41,080
I'll find a way to bring
in the best imperial physicians

391
00:30:41,128 --> 00:30:42,830
to examine everyone at Lin Residence.

392
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:43,960
Yes.

393
00:30:50,720 --> 00:30:52,280
With Lin Residence sealed off,

394
00:30:52,808 --> 00:30:54,030
they won't know for a while

395
00:30:54,039 --> 00:30:55,720
that you're outside.

396
00:30:56,839 --> 00:30:59,200
Why don't I stay in the open
while you remain hidden?

397
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:00,959
We can work together

398
00:31:00,960 --> 00:31:02,520
and lure the enemy in.

399
00:31:02,599 --> 00:31:04,359
We'll turn
their own scheme against them.

400
00:31:06,079 --> 00:31:07,760
Then we'll catch them in our trap.

401
00:31:17,599 --> 00:31:18,679
If you've been examined,

402
00:31:18,680 --> 00:31:20,599
hurry and get dressed.

403
00:31:26,839 --> 00:31:27,758
What's wrong with her?

404
00:31:27,759 --> 00:31:28,558
Look at her hand.

405
00:31:28,559 --> 00:31:30,240
Keep your voice down.

406
00:31:30,960 --> 00:31:32,078
Look at her body.

407
00:31:32,079 --> 00:31:33,119
Her skin is all ulcerated.

408
00:31:34,440 --> 00:31:36,879
How did Yuchan end up like this?

409
00:31:36,880 --> 00:31:38,118
How could Yuchan...

410
00:31:38,119 --> 00:31:39,919
She... She won't die, will she?

411
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:41,038
It's terrifying.

412
00:31:41,039 --> 00:31:42,278
Don't talk nonsense.

413
00:31:42,279 --> 00:31:43,720
How could that happen?

414
00:31:43,799 --> 00:31:45,159
But she looks so frightening.

415
00:31:45,160 --> 00:31:46,278
Look at her face and neck.

416
00:31:46,279 --> 00:31:47,800
How did she end up like this?

417
00:31:51,079 --> 00:31:53,839
First Madam
won't just abandon us, will she?

418
00:32:06,119 --> 00:32:07,239
First Madam,

419
00:32:07,240 --> 00:32:08,639
we've checked everyone carefully.

420
00:32:08,640 --> 00:32:12,399
Madam Han, Lanxiang, Gantang, and Baogai

421
00:32:12,400 --> 00:32:14,000
don't have any red rashes.

422
00:32:17,880 --> 00:32:20,879
It seems this epidemic
isn't that contagious.

423
00:32:21,599 --> 00:32:23,399
Gantang and Lanxiang

424
00:32:23,400 --> 00:32:26,119
have been caring for Yuchan
these past two days, and they're fine.

425
00:32:29,576 --> 00:32:30,696
When Yuchan first fell ill,

426
00:32:30,728 --> 00:32:33,230
I thought it was only a pollen rash
or some other minor rash,

427
00:32:33,240 --> 00:32:34,720
nothing serious.

428
00:32:34,880 --> 00:32:35,999
Young Master also told me

429
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:37,558
not to disturb First Madam

430
00:32:37,559 --> 00:32:40,200
and to let Yuchan recuperate
in the courtyard for a few days.

431
00:32:40,599 --> 00:32:43,078
So I didn't report it
to First Madam right away.

432
00:32:43,079 --> 00:32:45,119
I never expected it to be an epidemic.

433
00:32:45,400 --> 00:32:46,919
It's all my fault.

434
00:32:47,119 --> 00:32:48,720
Please punish me, First Madam.

435
00:32:49,176 --> 00:32:52,264
- Please punish us, First Madam.
- Please punish us, First Madam.

436
00:32:53,559 --> 00:32:56,079
You're part of Zhichun Hall now.

437
00:32:56,168 --> 00:32:57,790
Since Young Master gave the order,

438
00:32:57,799 --> 00:32:59,359
you naturally had to obey.

439
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:01,439
As for the epidemic,

440
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:03,040
none of us could have foreseen it.

441
00:33:04,720 --> 00:33:06,079
All of you, get up.

442
00:33:06,440 --> 00:33:08,744
Thank you for sparing us,
First Madam.

443
00:33:08,792 --> 00:33:11,910
- Thank you for sparing us, First Madam.
- Thank you for sparing us, First Madam.

444
00:33:15,079 --> 00:33:16,200
Madam Han.

445
00:33:16,590 --> 00:33:18,504
Take some people
and prepare all the rooms

446
00:33:18,552 --> 00:33:20,320
in Zhichun Hall as quickly as possible.

447
00:33:20,599 --> 00:33:22,720
This is no time to be particular.

448
00:33:22,799 --> 00:33:24,919
As long as they're
habitable, they'll do.

449
00:33:25,599 --> 00:33:26,520
Yes.

450
00:33:28,799 --> 00:33:29,278
Baogai.

451
00:33:29,279 --> 00:33:30,518
Take Hongliao

452
00:33:30,519 --> 00:33:32,278
and prepare the east wing.

453
00:33:32,279 --> 00:33:33,439
Lanxiang, Gantang.

454
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:35,359
Come with me to prepare the west wing.

455
00:33:45,599 --> 00:33:47,919
- Mother.
- First Madam.

456
00:33:48,359 --> 00:33:49,798
As you instructed,

457
00:33:49,799 --> 00:33:50,639
we checked everyone

458
00:33:50,640 --> 00:33:51,919
in Yujiao Garden.

459
00:33:51,920 --> 00:33:53,479
No one has developed a red rash.

460
00:33:53,480 --> 00:33:55,159
We've already locked the courtyard gate.

461
00:33:55,288 --> 00:33:57,176
(Wei, Qin's first-class maid)
Here's the key.

462
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:58,879
Keep it safe.

463
00:33:58,880 --> 00:34:01,439
The gate may only be opened
each day when meals are delivered.

464
00:34:01,440 --> 00:34:02,560
Yes.

465
00:34:12,880 --> 00:34:14,320
- Mother.
- Aunt Shunhua.

466
00:34:14,792 --> 00:34:15,976
Given the circumstances,

467
00:34:16,008 --> 00:34:18,168
it'll be easier for everyone
to look after one another.

468
00:34:18,184 --> 00:34:20,750
For the time being, you'll have
to put up with some inconvenience

469
00:34:20,760 --> 00:34:22,600
and all stay at Zhichun Hall.

470
00:34:22,610 --> 00:34:24,790
(Tan Suhua, Lin Jinlan's wife)
Once the epidemic is over,

471
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:26,640
you can move back.

472
00:34:26,960 --> 00:34:28,039
Yes.

473
00:34:28,280 --> 00:34:29,839
Shunhua.

474
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:31,640
Shunhua.

475
00:34:35,039 --> 00:34:36,959
Everything was perfectly fine.

476
00:34:37,079 --> 00:34:39,399
How did an epidemic suddenly break out?

477
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:44,319
I'm telling you,

478
00:34:44,320 --> 00:34:45,439
in my courtyard alone,

479
00:34:45,440 --> 00:34:47,959
four people were found with rashes.

480
00:34:57,599 --> 00:34:59,238
Didn't I tell you

481
00:34:59,239 --> 00:35:01,078
to bring only your personal attendants

482
00:35:01,079 --> 00:35:03,319
and pack only a few daily necessities?

483
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:05,879
Why did you bring so many people
and so much luggage?

484
00:35:07,519 --> 00:35:08,879
It was my fault.

485
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,718
I didn't explain it clearly
to Second Madam.

486
00:35:10,719 --> 00:35:13,120
Nanxing, Yinxian, and Lingdang, stay.

487
00:35:13,280 --> 00:35:15,519
Everyone else, go back.

488
00:35:17,960 --> 00:35:19,080
Go on.

489
00:35:23,239 --> 00:35:26,120
In the outer residence,
except for Old Master, Old Madam,

490
00:35:26,159 --> 00:35:28,598
and Fourth Young Master,
who lives with them,

491
00:35:28,599 --> 00:35:30,439
everyone else, without exception,

492
00:35:30,440 --> 00:35:32,120
must remain in the inner residence.

493
00:35:33,519 --> 00:35:35,598
Yuchan, Jinqi's senior maid,

494
00:35:35,599 --> 00:35:37,319
Madam Wu from my household,

495
00:35:37,320 --> 00:35:39,238
Second Young Lady's
wet nurse, Madam Zhou,

496
00:35:39,239 --> 00:35:41,118
and the other servants
who have fallen ill

497
00:35:41,119 --> 00:35:43,399
have all been moved
to Fengqi Courtyard for isolation.

498
00:35:44,400 --> 00:35:45,799
From now on,

499
00:35:45,800 --> 00:35:47,800
no one is to move
about without permission.

500
00:35:47,920 --> 00:35:50,039
Every courtyard will be locked.

501
00:35:51,159 --> 00:35:52,399
The gates may only be opened

502
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:53,800
when meals are delivered.

503
00:35:59,519 --> 00:36:00,479
Shunhua.

504
00:36:00,480 --> 00:36:01,919
Are you staying here, too?

505
00:36:02,599 --> 00:36:03,999
Xiushu is ill.

506
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:06,320
I have to return
to Rongzhang House to care for her.

507
00:36:07,320 --> 00:36:09,198
If anyone else falls ill,

508
00:36:09,200 --> 00:36:11,384
members of the family
will be moved to Rongzhang House

509
00:36:11,416 --> 00:36:12,590
to stay with us.

510
00:36:12,599 --> 00:36:15,479
The maids and nannies
will go to Fengqi Courtyard.

511
00:36:19,400 --> 00:36:20,800
Where's Jinqi?

512
00:36:27,840 --> 00:36:28,959
Yes.

513
00:36:29,440 --> 00:36:30,718
Where is your Young Master?

514
00:36:30,719 --> 00:36:32,439
Why haven't we seen him all this time?

515
00:36:33,079 --> 00:36:34,439
Young Master...

516
00:36:43,480 --> 00:36:45,240
Young Master isn't at Zhichun Hall.

517
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:49,559
What?

518
00:36:49,920 --> 00:36:52,080
You're saying Jinqi isn't here?

519
00:36:52,239 --> 00:36:53,120
Then...

520
00:36:53,199 --> 00:36:54,359
where did he go?

521
00:36:54,360 --> 00:36:55,640
Where did he go?

522
00:36:56,440 --> 00:36:59,439
Before the night curfew tonight,
a friend came looking for Jinqi,

523
00:36:59,440 --> 00:37:01,080
so he went out.

524
00:37:01,128 --> 00:37:02,750
Now that the residence has been sealed,

525
00:37:02,760 --> 00:37:05,479
he couldn't come back
even if he wanted to.

526
00:37:06,719 --> 00:37:07,959
At a time like this,

527
00:37:07,960 --> 00:37:09,399
Jinqi isn't here.

528
00:37:10,440 --> 00:37:11,359
Jinqi isn't here.

529
00:37:11,360 --> 00:37:12,959
What are we going to do?

530
00:37:12,960 --> 00:37:14,200
What are we going to do?

531
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:25,720
This...

532
00:37:26,840 --> 00:37:28,559
What are we going to do?

533
00:37:48,880 --> 00:37:50,680
Given the situation,

534
00:37:50,800 --> 00:37:53,600
it's definitely better
that Jinqi is outside.

535
00:37:54,280 --> 00:37:56,479
No one in the entire residence
is allowed to leave now.

536
00:37:56,480 --> 00:37:59,359
Even friends and relatives
would find it hard to help.

537
00:37:59,480 --> 00:38:00,799
With Jinqi outside,

538
00:38:00,800 --> 00:38:03,479
he can make arrangements on our behalf

539
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:06,519
and seek help
from the Imperial Medical Service.

540
00:38:07,239 --> 00:38:08,320
That's right.

541
00:38:10,079 --> 00:38:11,959
I really was confused.

542
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:13,640
You see things more clearly.

543
00:38:13,960 --> 00:38:15,638
With Jinqi's abilities,

544
00:38:15,639 --> 00:38:17,399
I'm sure it won't be long

545
00:38:17,400 --> 00:38:19,038
before all those soldiers outside

546
00:38:19,039 --> 00:38:20,879
are withdrawn.

547
00:38:20,880 --> 00:38:22,240
They'll all be withdrawn.

548
00:38:22,456 --> 00:38:24,590
If Jinqi were here,
he would naturally be in charge.

549
00:38:24,599 --> 00:38:25,959
But now that he isn't,

550
00:38:25,960 --> 00:38:27,680
and First Madam
isn't staying here either,

551
00:38:27,719 --> 00:38:30,640
with so many people in this courtyard,
someone has to take charge.

552
00:38:31,039 --> 00:38:32,518
Since Jinqi isn't here,

553
00:38:32,519 --> 00:38:34,640
Jinlan should naturally take charge.

554
00:38:37,780 --> 00:38:40,078
(Zhou Guizhi, Lin Changzheng's
concubine and Lin Jinlan's mother)

555
00:38:40,079 --> 00:38:41,320
First Madam.

556
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:44,240
I know Jinlan is capable,

557
00:38:44,440 --> 00:38:46,559
but with so many people to worry about,

558
00:38:47,480 --> 00:38:49,600
I'm afraid it may be too much for him.

559
00:38:52,880 --> 00:38:55,080
Madam Han and Lanxiang

560
00:38:55,119 --> 00:38:57,479
are the people Jinqi relies on most.

561
00:38:59,880 --> 00:39:00,999
Jinlan,

562
00:39:01,320 --> 00:39:02,919
you just need to oversee things.

563
00:39:03,039 --> 00:39:05,959
Leave the actual work to Madam Han

564
00:39:05,960 --> 00:39:07,839
and Lanxiang.

565
00:39:10,760 --> 00:39:12,240
Then it's settled.

566
00:39:22,159 --> 00:39:23,240
First Madam.

567
00:39:32,760 --> 00:39:34,238
I've studied medicine for many years.

568
00:39:34,239 --> 00:39:35,680
I wouldn't claim to have mastered it,

569
00:39:35,840 --> 00:39:37,800
but I do know a fair amount.

570
00:39:38,320 --> 00:39:39,816
Xiushu is ill now,

571
00:39:39,848 --> 00:39:42,530
and the imperial physicians won't
be able to get in anytime soon.

572
00:39:42,616 --> 00:39:44,590
Why don't I go examine Xiushu

573
00:39:44,599 --> 00:39:46,080
and the other patients?

574
00:39:46,320 --> 00:39:49,598
That way, I can
at least ease their suffering

575
00:39:49,599 --> 00:39:51,200
and slow the progression of the illness.

576
00:39:57,039 --> 00:40:00,080
True gold is tested by fire,
and true courage by adversity.

577
00:40:00,199 --> 00:40:01,759
Others flee at the mere mention

578
00:40:01,760 --> 00:40:03,198
of an epidemic.

579
00:40:03,199 --> 00:40:05,320
You are truly a heroine.

580
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:07,919
Indeed.

581
00:40:08,559 --> 00:40:11,038
Young Lady Du's sincerity is admirable.

582
00:40:11,039 --> 00:40:11,839
Shunhua.

583
00:40:11,840 --> 00:40:13,720
Let her go see Xiushu.

584
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:22,559
Then...

585
00:40:36,280 --> 00:40:37,720
Is it this kind?

586
00:40:39,920 --> 00:40:42,280
This is a larkspur
flower ornament I made.

587
00:40:42,480 --> 00:40:44,118
Since larkspur shares my name,

588
00:40:44,119 --> 00:40:45,800
I made a few extra

589
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:47,959
to wear from time to time.

590
00:40:48,119 --> 00:40:49,760
How did this get here?

591
00:40:57,159 --> 00:40:58,558
It's late.

592
00:40:58,559 --> 00:40:59,760
You're tired, too.

593
00:41:00,039 --> 00:41:01,439
Let's all get some sleep.

594
00:41:02,000 --> 00:41:03,240
Tomorrow,

595
00:41:03,400 --> 00:41:04,359
we'll see

596
00:41:04,760 --> 00:41:07,680
what the Defense Command plans to do.

597
00:41:07,760 --> 00:41:10,760
Perhaps the imperial physicians
will come by then.

598
00:41:17,039 --> 00:41:18,519
First Madam is right.

599
00:42:04,320 --> 00:42:05,439
Gantang.

600
00:42:07,480 --> 00:42:08,680
Second Madam.

601
00:42:08,920 --> 00:42:10,120
This way, please.

602
00:42:13,920 --> 00:42:15,320
We'll share a room.

603
00:42:20,648 --> 00:42:22,424
Second Young Master. Third Young Master.

604
00:42:22,456 --> 00:42:24,760
Please follow me.

605
00:42:25,360 --> 00:42:26,559
I'm exhausted.

606
00:42:26,920 --> 00:42:28,319
Luckily, I've already washed up.

607
00:42:28,320 --> 00:42:29,720
I can go straight to bed.

608
00:42:42,920 --> 00:42:43,999
Third Young Lady.

609
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:45,760
I'll show you to your room.

610
00:42:48,360 --> 00:42:49,280
All right.

611
00:42:49,480 --> 00:42:50,680
Thank you.

612
00:42:51,360 --> 00:42:52,919
You're welcome, Third Young Lady.

613
00:43:04,980 --> 00:43:07,820
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

614
00:43:15,400 --> 00:43:16,879
Lingdang.

615
00:43:17,880 --> 00:43:19,519
Lingdang.

616
00:43:22,199 --> 00:43:24,320
Lingdang.

617
00:43:34,079 --> 00:43:37,839
Lingdang! How did this happen?

618
00:43:38,559 --> 00:43:40,839
My poor Lingdang.

619
00:43:41,079 --> 00:43:41,999
Lingdang.

620
00:43:43,400 --> 00:43:44,759
Lingdang, hold on.

621
00:43:44,760 --> 00:43:45,759
Lingdang.

622
00:43:45,760 --> 00:43:47,240
I can save you.

623
00:43:47,760 --> 00:43:48,839
Lingdang!

624
00:44:06,140 --> 00:44:10,260
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

625
00:44:13,100 --> 00:44:17,620
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

626
00:44:18,900 --> 00:44:22,820
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

627
00:44:23,500 --> 00:44:26,260
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

628
00:44:26,980 --> 00:44:29,300
♪Though all the world may fade♪

629
00:44:29,300 --> 00:44:32,380
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

630
00:44:33,900 --> 00:44:38,140
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

631
00:44:41,060 --> 00:44:45,220
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

632
00:44:47,020 --> 00:44:50,580
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

633
00:44:50,580 --> 00:44:54,140
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

634
00:44:54,940 --> 00:45:00,620
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

635
00:45:00,980 --> 00:45:05,300
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

636
00:45:05,660 --> 00:45:08,620
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

637
00:45:08,620 --> 00:45:12,380
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

638
00:45:12,380 --> 00:45:15,260
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

639
00:45:15,260 --> 00:45:19,340
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

640
00:45:19,340 --> 00:45:22,700
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

641
00:45:22,700 --> 00:45:26,460
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

642
00:45:26,460 --> 00:45:30,460
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

643
00:45:31,220 --> 00:45:35,380
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

644
00:45:35,380 --> 00:45:38,820
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

